{ "status": "answered", "answer": "A party can assign this agreement without the other party's consent, but the non-assigning party must be notified, and it has the right to terminate the agreement within 30 days.",

  "citations": [
    { "chunk_id": "C5", "quote": "(a) This Agreement may be assigned or otherwise transferred, by operation of law or otherwise without the express written consent of PARTY_1 and Dassault Systemes, but in such event the assigning Party shall give notice to the non-assigning Party and the non-assigning Party shall have the right to terminate this Agreement within the 30-day period following receipt of such notice." }
  ] }
